And here's another related question/example. This works
JavaScript:
PluginManager.registerCommand(pluginName, "setTop", args => {
        var mymap = Number(args.topmap);
        console.log(mymap);
    });
but if I reference args.topmap other places (not in the registerCommand {} things), it's, like, "wtf is args?"
